{'symbol': 'WRK', 'date': '2021-03-02 07:00:00', 'title': 'WESTROCK ANNOUNCES CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER SUCCESSION STEVEN C. VOORHEES TO STEP DOWN AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER; BOARD OF DIRECTORS ELECTS DAVID B.', 'text': "ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WESTROCK COMPANY (NYSE:WRK), A LEADING PROVIDER OF DIFFERENTIATED PAPER AND PACKAGING SOLUTIONS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT STEVEN C. VOORHEES HAS DECIDED TO STEP DOWN FROM HIS POSITION AS PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND A DIRECTOR OF THE COMPANY FOR HEALTH REASONS, EFFECTIVE MARCH 15, 2021. IN ADDITION, THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS ANNOUNCED THAT, FOLLOWING A COMPREHENSIVE SEARCH AS PART OF THE COMPANY'S LONG-TERM SUCCESSION PROCESSES, IT HAS ELECTED DAVID B."}